  << /ActualText (I\031m a Product Designer with 4\053 years of experience building and designing mobile apps\054 desktop applications\054 and systems\056 I enjoy turning complex problems into simple\054 thoughtful solutions based on user\055centered principles\056 Today much of my work happens alongside AI tools  to boost productivity\054 accelerate research and build workflows more efficiently\056 I have a proven ability to own end\055to\055end design\054 from concept to pixel\055perfect execution\054 delivering measurable product value while collaborating effectively with cross\055functional teams\056)
