978 0 obj
  << /ActualText (UX\057UI Designer at Oddity  \174 July 2023 \055 June 2026\nLed end\055to\055end UX design to drive revenue\054 conversion\054 and engagement\056\nOwned full design cycles from concept through research\054 design execution\054 and continuous improvements\056\n Led new brand design\054 shaping visual identity and product experience\056\n Conducted user research through interviews\054 usability testing and behavioral analysis\056\n Created wire\055frames\054 mock\055ups\054 user flows \046 prototypes focusing on user\055centered principles\056\n Collaborated cross\055functionally with Product\054 R\046D\054 and customer\055facing teams\056\n Clearly and effectively communicate design decisions to stakeholders\056\n Designed high\055quality experiences across web\054 desktop\054 and mobile\056\n Integrated AI tools \050Cursor\054 Claude\054 Figma Make\051 into the product design process to speed up research\054 design exploration\054 prototyping\054 and developer handoff\056\nBuilt AI\055driven product matching experiences \050e\056g\056\054 quiz\055based personalization\051\056)
     /K [ 8 ]
     /P 979 0 R
     /Pg 962 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

