980 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Product Designer at Skeep \050SaaS \055 B2B\051 \174 June 2022 \055 June 2023\nSimplified complex workflows into intuitive\054 user\055friendly experiences\056\nLed application redesign\054 defining new interface and behavior\056\nCreate user scenarios\054 journey map\054 wireframes\054 UI designs \046 prototypes for full product cycle\056\nDrove product improvements and new features alongside Product Managers and R\046D\056\nConducted user research through customer interviews\054 competitor analysis\054 and market trends\056\nLed QA process for internal system\056\nProficient in Figma and Adobe tools \050Photoshop\054 Illustrator\054 After Effects\051\056)
     /K [ 9 ]
